scalemark-by-suricrasiaonline (1.0+git20190621-0ddebs3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/patches : 04_makefile-system-minifier-hardening.patch, minify
    both shaders with the system Shader Minifier (the bundled 1.1.5 exe
    was used for the fullscreen shader), use CPPFLAGS/LDFLAGS and pkg-
    config CFLAGS
  * debian/patches : 05_portable-code-and-window-option.patch, libc
    instead of raw x86 syscalls (builds on ARM), clean exit at the end
    of the song, -w/--window option for the 640x360 variant, fixed one
    byte overread and shader log written on stdin
  * debian/patches : 03_fix-some-SDL2.patch, fixed the header
    (AUDIO_S16MSB is intentional)
  * debian/rules : enabled hardening=+all
  * debian/control : Architecture any, libgl-dev instead of libglu-dev,
    removed the unneeded common-install-function-ddebs dependency,
    improved description
  * debian/resources : added the missing icon (the PNG was empty)
  * debian/scalemark-by-suricrasiaonline.6.md : documented the options
  * debian : lintian overrides (pandoc groff-message, upstream
    shader_minifier.exe) and Keywords in the desktop file

